name: auto-performance-booster
description: Automatically cleans Termux cache, optimizes RAM, checks battery thermal state, and locks Vivo 144Hz performance.
instructions: |
  1. Check device CPU temperatures and battery health using Termux commands.
  2. Clear stale temp files and cache in ~/.cache and /tmp.
  3. Verify bypass charging state and thermal cooling profile.
  4. Log a clean diagnostic summary.
